  <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-4">Common Patterns</h3>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-1 mb-6">
    <li>Section padding: <code class="bg-gray-200 px-1 rounded">py-12</code> to <code class="bg-gray-200 px-1 rounded">py-16</code> (48–64px)</li>
    <li>Container max-width: <code class="bg-gray-200 px-1 rounded">max-w-6xl</code> (72rem = 1152px)</li>
    <li>Card padding: <code class="bg-gray-200 px-1 rounded">p-6</code> (24px)</li>
    <li>Stack spacing: <code class="bg-gray-200 px-1 rounded">space-y-4</code> to <code class="bg-gray-200 px-1 rounded">space-y-6</code></li>
    <li>Inline spacing: <code class="bg-gray-200 px-1 rounded">space-x-2</code> to <code class="bg-gray-200 px-1 rounded">space-x-4</code></li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-4">Responsive Breakpoints</h3>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-1">
    <li><code class="bg-gray-200 px-1 rounded">sm</code>: 640px</li>
    <li><code class="bg-gray-200 px-1 rounded">md</code>: 768px</li>
